grated_image.png", "id": "576345286298093", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162791_194200944514699_6976310366665965568_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dpGBBVmGzKkQ7kNvwHCETbH&_nc_oc=AdlXGCht1dVlsvP5gxf57gXvKmtS0JqY2c2tEmCDL6UemeKKZew4yXRcW_cCEaeRxJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvayC43fceznqDkxblbNVp_zO2FIk3rK4sQxJm5pPLGuw&oe=699AEE1C"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "840229886440289", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386401_178839952894596_7973465854262116352_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1rXlJlZ68YUQ7kNvwHt0jpp&_nc_oc=Adl4Wn2tCSvj4HE5YuAMzNgdl1vcc0uDtiwaaNICkYIiUFheaFFRUYqr-d2iQWXjkkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQyoP6QSvzFGABp1x-64PhrAX-_ABnfTaL4Raj9lXWAQ&oe=699B09F5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "240985190371600", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/10000000_191517794790710_819105329122902016_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w0BLBUsu4HIQ7kNvwHbAWgK&_nc_oc=Adn6vgaUobc9CLRkbSFMrFHBCQmo11YhqA-cTv89OENDjqcvOO2Z3uI1jahq-TIekvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvdiUQiguQ3J4xPwS0Pp191pwgZu-Ti89FpY36RmEpuqw&oe=699AE3D7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "202715584292613", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139031_863197173880556_8309859727383199744_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Iud6DnxdCVoQ7kNvwGzeqJC&_nc_oc=AdmyVJhfO3YrGJikb0x6Cp-kcZokL96d5FenWJ2eAM7TbdrcxkwsTlJtpFyTlCykcsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuWxr1yvlXqVul_hw7E-9wnQRcENelFGA2TIJ997c00yg&oe=699B11C9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2643834889078100", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12448944_162446487752374_4171312266970398720_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VjKhRgcQcYgQ7kNvwGsrFP_&_nc_oc=Adl_EjiFz34jp_zFp-aD8euDu4qvAvy90UBoaXAHByAV66XSxDxmfhvg5O_ACSZD6og&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuN6cF7YxGmT5sS50yg2p-4n1dx01WPydGaY4lymAuB7g&oe=699B0DB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Discovering Space", "keywords": ["space", "exploration", "simulation", "solar", "explore"], "long_description": "* Learn the about some of our close neighbours, through an intensely engaging experience.\n\n* Contemplate the awesomeness and remoteness of space.\n\n\u2026 or just simply enjoy the ride.\n\n\nHighlights:\n\nTake a high orbit around the earth, visit the far side of the Moon. Fly in close to Moon\u2019s surface and understand the formation of lunar features.\n\nSee our fragile home, Earth, from a completely new perspective.\n\nVisit Mars and its companion moons. Fly in low and close over some of Mars\u2019 ancient geological features.\n\nGo deeper into the Solar system; graze upon Jupiter\u2019s swirling clouds and swing around some of its fascinating moons.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n* High quality 3d real-time rendered visuals for truly immersive feel.\n* True to scale planets and moons.\n* Engaging soundtrack and audio.\n* Three tours, between 5 and 10 minutes each.", "short_description": "A breath-taking space discovery experience through a series of guided and narrated tours."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "DiscoveringVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lang